  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QzKrYCCHVQUGCeNvWyWYgqU16YKGf7bQ/view?usp=sharing\" alt=\"\" /></strong></em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7OMxE0O.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"355\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OQPSsK7.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"158\" /></span></h2>\n\n<center><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/991653013301243935?color=8080ff&amp;label=%20&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"25\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/The_Great_ZIN\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitter-00ccff?color=0099cc&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Twitter\" height=\"25\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH5jS1COXwctDX72og2wt_g\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-B8121D?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"YouTube\" height=\"25\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/TheGreatZin\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-1a1a1a?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=GitHub&amp;logoColor=white.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"25\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/thegreatzin/tiers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-F16061?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"25\" /></a></p></center>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 400;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\" /></p>\n<h3 class=\"LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<div>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AmhpJpL.png\" alt=\"Medieval Paintings\" width=\"1088\" height=\"512\" /></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><br /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\" /></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>📖 關於 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">使用《中世紀畫作》模組提升你的我的世界世界魅力！新增超過 50 幅展現中世紀奇幻藝術之美的畫作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">畫作的解析度為 16x16，且貼合原版風格的紋理能完美融入我的世界世界。像放置一般畫作物品一樣放置它們，即可裝飾你的建築內部。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\">Discord 伺服器</a>，向我的世界社群展示你的藝術才華。我們設有專屬頻道，供希望作品被收錄至本模組的藝術家使用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">若要將原版畫作替換為中世紀風格 -</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">下載資源包 -&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/medieval-paintings</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\" /></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>❓ 常見問題 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：你會將模組移植到 Fabric 嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;不會。我可不想自虐。</span></p>\n<hr />\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：你能更新到最新版本嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;可以，我會針對每一個新的大型我的世界版本進行更新。</span></p>\n<hr />\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：你會移植到 1.12.2/1.7.10 嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;不會。那意味著我必須重新學習如何開發模組。</span></p>\n<hr />\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：你能新增 ... 嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\">Discord 伺服器</a>。那裡有專屬的頻道討論此類建議。如果我看重你的點子，它很有機會被收錄。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\" /></span></p>\n<h3 class=\"LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>🔗 連結 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp; 在此你可以支持我並追蹤我的專案！</span></p>\n\n<center><p><br /><strong><a title=\"Ko-fi\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/thegreatzin/tiers\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Mxd8fG.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" /></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a title=\"YouTube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH5jS1COXwctDX72og2wt_g\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NcF3t4h.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" /></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/The_Great_ZIN\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FWYdXSv.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" /></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a title=\"Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MpQaGnk.png\" width=\"413\" height=\"110\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\" /></span></p></center>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
